<section class="twopass-section not-content">
  <div class="twopass-container">
    <div class="twopass-header">
      <span class="twopass-eyebrow">Methodology</span>
      <h2 class="twopass-title">The Two-Pass Curriculum</h2>
      <p class="twopass-desc">
        Security cannot be learned through disconnected vulnerability lists. We first construct the complete functional architecture, then systematically evaluate its threat model.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twopass-grid">
      <div class="pass-column">
        <div class="pass-num">01</div>
        <h3 class="pass-heading">Understand the system</h3>
        <p class="pass-text">
          First build the complete mental model: architecture, context windows, memory structures, retrieval systems, tool dispatching, identity delegation, execution environments, observability, and workflows.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pass-column">
        <div class="pass-num">02</div>
        <h3 class="pass-heading">Secure the system</h3>
        <p class="pass-text">
          Then revisit that exact same architecture through: threat models, trust boundaries, indirect prompt injection controls, secure execution sandboxes, automated evaluation, and reference security architectures.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .twopass-section {
    padding: 3rem 1rem 3.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .twopass-container {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .twopass-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .twopass-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-teal);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .twopass-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.85rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .twopass-desc {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .twopass-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .pass-column {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .pass-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-teal);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .pass-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .pass-text {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .twopass-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
